Subject: [PATCH 1/4] App Store: restyle Discover as macOS's App Store

A frameless window with a frosted sidebar (stoplights, search, Discover,
Create/Work/Play/Develop, Categories, Updates, the account card), a
Discover page of feature cards and shelves, category and search pages in
columns, an app page with a facts strip, macOS's Get button with an
install progress ring, and a Categories page of tiles. Follows the
system accent colour.

